or lei ou acordadas entre o empregador e o colaborador.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<button class=\"ekit-unfold-btn\">Ler Mais<\/button>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-2df9ad6\" data-id=\"2df9ad6\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-75de699 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-unfold\" data-id=\"75de699\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-unfold.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\t\t\t<div data-config=\"{&quot;expand_text&quot;:&quot;Ler Mais&quot;,&quot;collapse_text&quot;:&quot;Ler Menos&quot;,&quot;collapse_height&quot;:&quot;160&quot;,&quot;transition_duration&quot;:&quot;300&quot;}\" class=\"ekit-unfold-wrapper ekit-expand-directio-above ekit-unfold-wrapper-align-\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"ekit-unfold-heading\">Trabalho suplementar<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-unfold-data\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-unfold-data-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-unfold-raw-content\"><p>Regista e calcula automaticamente as horas extraordin\u00e1rias realizadas pelos colaboradores. Aplica as devidas compensa\u00e7\u00f5es de acordo com a lei laboral e as pol\u00edticas da empresa, seja em termos de remunera\u00e7\u00e3o adicional ou de tempo de descanso compensat\u00f3rio.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<button class=\"ekit-unfold-btn\">Ler Mais<\/button>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-i